.TH NN-SPARSITY 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-sparsity \- analyze weight sparsity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn sparsity [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Count zeros and near-zeros in constant tensors.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-threshold VALUE
Near-zero threshold.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn sparsity model.onnx --threshold 1e-6
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-quant(1), nn-tensors(1)
